# The native form's lines, read after package.args (`make package FORM=native`):
# an ordinary program built with the NBT toolchain, started by NBT Manager
# itself. No runner, so bridge 1.5 does. An application that keeps this form
# puts these values in package.args and removes this file.
--bridge
1.5
--bridge-uses
show,controller
